        "color": 7,
        "width": 220,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### 2. Your settings\n\nThe only node you need to edit. List the search words you want watched, pick the Amazon marketplace (`de`, `com`, `co.uk` and so on) and how many pages of results to read.\n\nSet `quote_only` to `true` to see the price first."
